### 3.2 Composite Score Formula

Setiap game menghasilkan **Assessment Score (0-100)** dengan formula weighted:

```
AssessmentScore = (Accuracy × 0.35) + (Speed × 0.20) + (Progression × 0.25) + (Efficiency × 0.20)

dimana:
- Accuracy = (correct / total) × 100
- Speed = max(0, 100 - (avgResponseTime - idealTime) / idealTime × 50)
- Progression = (maxLevel / totalLevels) × 100
- Efficiency = max(0, 100 - (hints × 5) - (errors × 3))
```

### 3.3 Domain Composite Score

Setiap domain (Kognitif, Linguistik, dll) menghasilkan composite score dari game-game terkait:

```
CognitiveComposite = 
  (AlienShooter × 0.20) +     // Gf - Math
  (PatternRecog × 0.15) +     // Gwm - Pattern  
  (MemoryCard × 0.15) +       // Gsm - Visual Memory
  (SequenceMemory × 0.10) +   // Gwm - Sequential
  (NumberMemory × 0.10) +     // Gsm - Digit Span
  (NumberSequence × 0.10) +   // Gf - Inductive
  (DesertRoad × 0.10) +       // Gf - Logic
  (ShapeSorting × 0.05) +     // Gs - Speed
  (MirrorPattern × 0.05)      // Gv - Spatial
```

```
LinguisticComposite =
  (LinguisticTest × 0.35) +   // Gc - Comprehension
  (StoryBuilder × 0.25) +     // Glr - Expression
  (WordPuzzle × 0.25) +       // Gc - Vocabulary
  (SpellBee × 0.15)           // Gc - Spelling
```

